  "title": "Impact Sourcing Paves the Way for Financial Wellness",
  "summary": "Youth unemployment remains a significant challenge in South Africa, with countless young individuals struggling to find stable employment opportunities. However, amidst this crisis, impact sourcing emerges as a powerful solution that not only tackles unemployment but also promotes financial wellness for the newly employed youth. By integrating financial education and support into the national impact sourcing agenda, South Africa can pave the way for sustainable economic growth and empower its young workforce.",
